{
  "_about": [
    "THE settings schema of Sukrara V1: every user setting of the Android and Mac apps, so the platforms can't drift",
    "apart. 'numbers' are the number formats (stored units; valid = a preset, a special value, or a custom value in",
    "min..max on step; 'scale' = stored units per shown unit, 'nudge' = one stepper click). 'settings' is the inventory:",
    "each entry exists on both platforms or names the one platform in 'only' with the reason. Per platform: 'store' =",
    "Android Preferences DataStore file (by area) / Mac 'defaults' (UserDefaults) or 'system'; 'key' = the stored key",
    "(comma list = one key per place); 'path' = the field inside a JSON value (the alert settings are ONE key 'alerts'",
    "holding contracts/alerts/SPEC.md §3, '{kind}' = each alert kind). 'mirror' = a follower in 'Settings from: Wearer'",
    "takes the wearer's value ('wire' = its key in the wearer's settings event, contracts/protocol/PROTOCOL-v2.md).",
    "Generated code: python3 tools/settings/gen.py writes SettingsSpec.kt (:core:data) and SettingsSpec.swift",
    "(SukraraCore); tools/check rule 'settings' checks it; SettingsSchemaTest on both apps tests the models against it.",
    "PoC -> V1 key table: README.md here."
  ],
  "options": {
    "_about": "Option lists both platforms offer (the user, 2026-10-21: option lists must not diverge either). Each platform's list is tested against these values in order (SettingsSchemaTest, -settingsselftest); a value one platform can't offer goes in 'only' with the reason.",
    "exportPeriod": {"values": ["sensor", "7", "14", "30", "all"], "label": "Export data: this sensor, 7 / 14 / 30 days, all time"},
    "reportPeriod": {"values": ["1", "7", "14", "30"], "label": "Glucose report: 1 / 7 / 14 / 30 days"},
    "slotKind": {"values": ["TIR", "GMI", "AVERAGE", "CV"], "label": "What a slot beside the value shows"},
    "tirRange": {"values": ["IN_RANGE", "TIGHT"], "label": "What a ring's centre counts"},
    "lastPlace": {"values": ["OFF", "NEAR_VALUE", "END"], "label": "Last treatment position"},
    "soundPack": {"values": ["arcade", "kart", "quest", "soft", "system", "none"], "label": "Sound packs (and per alert)"},
    "settingsFrom": {"values": ["wearer", "default", "custom"], "label": "Followers: Settings from"},
    "markKind": {"values": ["rapid", "long", "carbs", "note"], "label": "Treatments on the graph: the kinds, in label order"},
    "markPart": {"values": ["point", "line", "amount", "time"], "label": "Treatments on the graph: what each kind can show (the marker, the mute line, the amount label, the time label)"},
    "markParts.rapid": {"values": ["point", "line", "amount", "time"], "label": "Rapid insulin: every part"},
    "markParts.long": {"values": ["point", "amount", "time"], "label": "Long-acting insulin: no mute line (it mutes nothing)"},
    "markParts.carbs": {"values": ["point", "line", "amount", "time"], "label": "Carbs: every part"},
    "markParts.note": {"values": ["point"], "label": "Notes: only the marker (no amount, mutes nothing)"},
    "markDefault.rapid": {"values": ["point", "line", "amount", "time"], "label": "Rapid insulin by default: everything"},
    "markDefault.long": {"values": ["point", "amount", "time"], "label": "Long-acting by default: everything"},
    "markDefault.carbs": {"values": ["point"], "label": "Carbs by default: only the point (the user, 2026-10-21)"},
    "markDefault.note": {"values": ["point"], "label": "Notes by default: the marker"}
  },
